  "category": { "zh": "MOS 视效", "en": "MOS VFX" },
  "name": { "zh": "mos_阴影", "en": "mos_shadow" },
  "description": {
    "zh": "方向轴阴影：用一条基线（两个点）和第三个点定义投影方向与长度，把图层轮廓压平后沿轴拉伸成阴影；离基线越远越模糊、越透明，颜色可调；可选直角/平滑二次弯折，可用原图层颜色，模糊与淡出可单独开关。",
    "en": "Directional-axis shadow: two baseline points plus a third point define the projection direction and length. The layer silhouette is flattened and stretched along that axis into a shadow; blur and transparency grow with distance from the baseline and the colour is adjustable. Optional hard or smooth quadratic bend, optional original-layer colour source, and separate blur/fade switches."
  },
  "groups": {
    "模糊和颜色": { "zh": "模糊和颜色", "en": "Blur & Color" },
